```ui
+-**---------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|filters_label..**.............................................................|
+----------------------------+----------------------+--------------------------+
|search_label..**........... | status_label..**.... | owner_label..**......... |
|search..**................. | status_filter.**.... | owner_filter..**........ |
+-**-------------------------+----------------------+--------------------------+
|                                                                              |
|apply_filters_btn.....  reset_filters_btn.....                                |
|                                                                              |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
```
